{"version":"1.5.0-alpha.2","notes":"## 1.5.0-alpha.2 - 2026-10-24\n\n### Features\n\n- Unlock the native quick panel using system secure storage, with a passphrase prompt only when needed (#2103)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Keep content unlocked when closing the main window or entering lightweight mode, and correctly dismiss the quick panel when switching to another window on Windows (#2103)\n- Show thumbnails and image previews for history entries containing a single image file in the native quick panel (#2105)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.5.0-alpha.2 - 2026-10-24\n\n### Features\n\n- 原生快捷面板支持通过系统安全存储解锁，仅在需要时提示输入口令 (#2103)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 关闭主窗口或进入轻量模式后保持内容解锁，并修复 Windows 上切换到其他窗口时快捷面板未正确收起的问题 (#2103)\n- 修复原生快捷面板中仅包含一个图片文件的历史条目不显示缩略图和图片预览的问题 (#2105)","confirmation_required":false,"confirmation_description":null,"pub_date":"2026-10-24T03:40:52Z","platforms":{"linux-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.2/UniClipboard_1.5.0-alpha.2_aarch64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"linux-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.2/UniClipboard_1.5.0-alpha.2_amd64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"windows-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.2/UniClipboard_1.5.0-alpha.2_arm64-setup.exe"},"windows-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.2/UniClipboard_1.5.0-alpha.2_x64-setup.exe"},"darwin-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.2/UniClipboard_aarch64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"},"darwin-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.2/UniClipboard_x86_64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"}}}